 106:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****       (+) On STM32F373xC/STM32F378xx devices, there are up to 
 107:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****           3 SDADC instances that can be enabled/disabled.
